Third-party data
----------------
Part B paragraph 3 grants no rights in third-party data. The SPL Inner Ear Atlas names no
third-party data source: the imaging is the DKFZ/SPL joint project's own flat-panel CT scan of a
temporal bone specimen, and the label maps and models are the named authors' work. (By contrast
the SPL Head and Neck Atlas is built on the MANIX CT series from the OsiriX DICOM image library,
which IS third-party data -- see docs/research/Q296_openanatomy_survey.md. No geometry from that
atlas is used here.)
